{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_75","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented and tuned the fused Triton attention-score kernel.\n\n- [kernel.py](/sgl-workspace/sol-execbench-rocm/artifacts/10/runs/full-01/codex/L1__031_repeat_kv_attention_matmul/packet/kernel.py)\n- [solution.json](/sgl-workspace/sol-execbench-rocm/artifacts/10/runs/full-01/codex/L1__031_repeat_kv_attention_matmul/packet/solution.json)\n\nFinal verification: **16/16 workloads passed**.\n\nMeasured speedups over the reference ranged from **1.78× to 8.03×**, including:\n\n- `B=1, S=4096`: 0.434 ms, 7.11×\n- `B=2, S=4096`: 0.850 ms, 7.16×\n- `B=2, S=2048`: 0.235 ms, 6.73×\n- `B=4, S=1024`: 0.128 ms, 6.54×\n\nThe implementation uses shape-aware tiling, cache-local block ordering for long sequences, and aligned padded output storage for irregular sequence lengths."}}
